                  <p style="text-align: justify;">
                    <strong style="color: rgb(4, 4, 61);">Milenge Secondary School</strong>, 
                    is a government institution offering quality education from Grade Eight to Grade Twelve. Our school is committed to fostering a learning environment where discipline and hard work are the keys to success. We aim to develop well-rounded students who excel academically and grow as responsible citizens.
